OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 11 MAY
OL,4,G2145FThe Essay: David Munrow - The
OL,5,     FPied Piper
OL,6,     GDavid Munrow changed how Britain
OL,7,     Glistened to music - fast, boldly,
OL,8,     Goften controversially. This
OL,9,     Gseries reflects on how his
OL,10,     Gpassion and creativity brought
OL,11,     Gforgotten sounds to life.
OL,12,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,13,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,14,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,15,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,16,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,17,     Geverything in between.
